{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/trackers\/consent"]}],"relationshipsSections":[{"type":"conformsTo","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/Trackers\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"kind":"relationships","title":"Conforms To"}],"sections":[],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Structure","symbolKind":"struct","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Consent","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"Consent","remoteSource":{"fileName":"Consent.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Traffluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Trackers\/Consent.swift#L42"},"role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"Trackers"}],"externalID":"s:8Trackers7ConsentV","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Consent"}]},"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent\/init(_:checkedHeldRecordLimit:)","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent\/init(_:heldRecordLimit:)"],"anchor":"Initializers","title":"Initializers","generated":true},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent\/dropReports","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent\/heldRecordCount"],"anchor":"Instance-Properties","title":"Instance Properties","generated":true},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent\/deny(_:)","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent\/grant(_:)","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent\/status(of:)"],"anchor":"Instance-Methods","title":"Instance Methods","generated":true},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent\/defaultHeldRecordLimit"],"anchor":"Type-Properties","title":"Type Properties","generated":true}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The user’s consent, category by category, which a tracker given it applies to every event."}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers"]]},"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Consent"}],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"overview","text":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The app makes one where it starts, from the decisions it saved, gives it to its tracker, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"updates it as the user decides:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["let consent = Consent([.analytics: .granted])","let tracker = Tracker(consent: consent)","\/\/ Later, from the consent prompt:","consent.grant(.advertising)"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Each event is gated by its type’s ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Event.consentCategory"},{"text":", by the decisions made before it was","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"tracked:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Granted:"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" delivered as any event is, written to the tracker’s store first if it has one."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Undecided:","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" held in memory, and not written to the store, until the category is decided."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Granting it delivers its held events in the order they were tracked, before any event"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tracked after the grant; denying it drops them, reported on "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent\/dropReports","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":". The hold keeps"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"at most "},{"code":"heldRecordLimit","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" events across every category and tracker: when it is full, its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"oldest is dropped to make room, reported as it happens (merged with the overflow reports"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"not yet read). Held events are lost if the app"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"ends first."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Denied:","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" dropped, and not collected at all, so not reported.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Records a store recovered from an earlier run are gated again as the tracker starts, as"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"consent may have changed since. One whose category is now denied is dropped, reported and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"forgotten by the store. One whose category is undecided is held outside the bound, still kept"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"by the store, so a full hold never drops it; if the app ends first, it is gated again on the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"next launch. One the store drops for its own byte bound while held is reported by the store"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and still delivered if granted in this run, as a record a delivery has already read is."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A category not given a status is undecided. Withdrawing consent is a denial: records the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tracker had already let through when it was granted are still delivered."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Copies share one set of decisions and one hold. A decision returns at once, from any thread:","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"it records the status, which ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent\/status(of:)","type":"reference"},{"text":" returns from then on, and queues the decision","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"for each tracker given the consent, whose own worker releases or drops what it held. Each","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"tracker reports its own drops.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"references":{"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Consent/heldRecordCount":{"abstract":[{"text":"How many records are held, waiting for their category to be decided: those held in memory","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"only and those a store recovered.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/consent\/heldrecordcount","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"heldRecordCount"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","text":"Int"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent\/heldRecordCount","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","role":"symbol","title":"heldRecordCount"},"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers":{"title":"Trackers","role":"collection","url":"\/documentation\/trackers","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","abstract":[],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers"},"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Consent/init(_:heldRecordLimit:)":{"title":"init(_:heldRecordLimit:)","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent\/init(_:heldRecordLimit:)","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/consent\/init(_:heldrecordlimit:)","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"init"},{"kind":"text","text":"(["},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:6Events15ConsentCategoryV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"ConsentCategory"},{"kind":"text"